  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\n<!-- Describe here the feature you are requesting. -->\r\n\r\nThis is a duplicate of https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/issues/3197. Since MSCs can take a long time to be merged, I'm hoping that Synapse and other homeservers can implement this ahead of spec.\r\n\r\nTL;DR: 2nd user's consent should be obtained before an invite to a 1:1 chat is sent out to a 3rd user.\r\n\r\nOR, invite functionality should be disabled for 1:1 chats by default, with extra steps required to enable it.",
